  "body_html": "<h1>Nature In Extensive Games</h1>\n<p>An extensive game with Nature has chance nodes at which no strategic player\nchooses an action. Instead, the game description specifies a probability\ndistribution over successors. A strategy profile of the strategic players then\ninduces a probability distribution over terminal outcomes.</p>",
